    <item>
      <title>国际货币基金组织在麦莉的电锯上押注数十亿美元，以避免过境</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/imf-bets-billions-on-milei-s-chainsaw-to-avert-past-debacles</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在阿根廷创纪录的金融救助案倒塌的六年后，国际货币基金组织再次为陷入困境的南美经济提供了数十亿美元，以支持类似的救援战略，这次是在贾维尔·米利（Javier Milei）的领导下。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/imf-bets-billions-on-milei-s-chainsaw-to-avert-past-debacles</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>钢铁救援后，英国将对中国投资持怀疑态度</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/uk-sees-high-trust-bar-for-chinese-investment-after-steel-rescue</link>
      <description><![CDATA[商务部长乔纳森·雷诺兹（Jonathan Reynolds）周日表示，英国政府将在被迫营救该国最后一家主要的钢铁制造商后，将采取更加怀疑的方法来对中国对经济敏感部门进行投资。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/uk-sees-high-trust-bar-for-chinese-investment-after-steel-rescue</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 10:29:35 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>中国的信用扩张范围预测债券发行洪水</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/china-s-credit-expansion-beats-forecast-on-bond-offering-deluge</link>
      <description><![CDATA[随着政府加速债券产品以帮助经济抵消美国关税对中国商品的影响，中国的信誉越来越多。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/china-s-credit-expansion-beats-forecast-on-bond-offering-deluge</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 10:14:42 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>伊朗的货币，随着美国核谈判的简历，股票攀升</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/iran-s-currency-stocks-climb-as-us-nuclear-talks-resume</link>
      <description><![CDATA[迈出了对德黑兰核计划的僵局的第一步，并缓解了美国的紧张局势，这激发了伊朗的货币和股票市场的反弹。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/iran-s-currency-stocks-climb-as-us-nuclear-talks-resume</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 09:58:36 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>奢侈品糖果店看起来占据了LVMH支持的沙特品牌全球</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/saudi-arabia-s-lvmh-backed-chocolatier-bateel-plans-huge-global-expansion</link>
      <description><![CDATA[农场工人从高耸的约会手掌的顶部稳步地悬挂着，用手辛苦地授粉了树木。在短短几天内，大约有100,000手掌可以施肥，今年春天的压力尤其强。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/saudi-arabia-s-lvmh-backed-chocolatier-bateel-plans-huge-global-expansion</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>伦敦最理想的社区失去了11,000名工人</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/london-s-most-desirable-neighborhoods-have-lost-11-000-workers</link>
      <description><![CDATA[肯辛顿（Kensington）和切尔西（Chelsea）长期以来一直吸引着愿意支付高昂住房费用的高收入工人，以居住在伦敦最耀眼的地区之一。现在他们要离开成千上万。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/london-s-most-desirable-neighborhoods-have-lost-11-000-workers</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 06:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>印度尼西亚因涉嫌在棕榈油案中贿赂而拘留法官</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/indonesia-detains-judge-for-alleged-bribery-in-palm-oil-case</link>
      <description><![CDATA[印度尼西亚拘留了南雅加达地方法院的首席法官，另外三人在贿赂调查中，与2022年的棕榈油出口腐败案有关，该案件涉及威尔马国际有限公司的单位。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/indonesia-detains-judge-for-alleged-bribery-in-palm-oil-case</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 05:00:44 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>日本不打算将我们用作关税谈话杠杆</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/japan-doesn-t-plan-to-use-us-treasuries-as-tariff-talk-leverage</link>
      <description><![CDATA[日本不打算将其美国财政股份用作谈判工具，以应对4月17日两国政府之间的会谈来应对美国关税。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/japan-doesn-t-plan-to-use-us-treasuries-as-tariff-talk-leverage</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 03:46:07 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>苹果在特朗普的关税特许权之前处于危机的边缘</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/apple-was-on-brink-of-crisis-before-tariff-concession-from-trump</link>
      <description><![CDATA[苹果公司（Apple Inc.）设法避开了自大流行以来最大的危机；至少目前。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/apple-was-on-brink-of-crisis-before-tariff-concession-from-trump</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 00:54:01 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>G-7中央银行准备对美国关税混乱的第一回应</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/central-banks-prepare-first-g-7-responses-to-us-chaos</link>
      <description><![CDATA[自从唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）发动贸易战争释放全球市场动荡以来，第一组七项货币政策决定可能会促使大西洋两侧的反应分歧。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/central-banks-prepare-first-g-7-responses-to-us-chaos</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 20:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
